<title>USA: Benthos CFO Sabella resigns.</title>
<headline>Benthos CFO Sabella resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH FALMOUTH, Mass. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benthos Inc said Tuesday that J. Luke Sabella, the company's treasurer and chief financial officer, has resigned effective October 25 to assume a position with a company closer to his home.</p>
<p>Benthos said it will search for a replacement.</p>
